{"3535090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LUNA : War of the Moonlight", "steam_appid": 3535090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Development Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/d4f3a452315abcbed564375183a3a5bb.avif?t=1766475377\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LUNA: War of the Moonlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  When the moon hanging over Earth shattered, its fragments rained down and threw the world into turmoil. Humanity was nearly annihilated. From these ruins emerged the Moon Spirit Clan (Leah), who had been hiding on the far side of the moon, and the Vampire Clan (Bellanoa), who had been concealed beneath Earth's surface. Humanity is nearly extinct, though a few survivors have gone deep into hiding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Boss Monster RAID</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LUNA: War of the Moonlights, various monsters lurk throughout the map. Defeat the most powerful boss monster and break down the barrier to infiltrate enemy lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An PvX MORPG with MOBA Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat boss monsters to acquire powerful items, and use them to crush endless waves of monsters and grow even stronger. Collect items of various grades and aim for even higher-grade ones. You can also purchase powerful, high-grade items from the shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time PvP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the massive real-time RvR battles between the Moon Spirit Clan (Leah) and the Vampire Clan (Bellanoa), and experience PvP action! Evade enemy attacks and exploit openings to deal devastating damage. Use both Normal and Ultimate Skills strategically to dominate the battlefield and prove yourself as the top player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/41ed9cb6931f3979341a39f55ec7f7b3.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/41ed9cb6931f3979341a39f55ec7f7b3.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/41ed9cb6931f3979341a39f55ec7f7b3.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LUNA: War of the Moonlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  When the moon hanging over Earth shattered, its fragments rained down and threw the world into turmoil. Humanity was nearly annihilated. From these ruins emerged the Moon Spirit Clan (Leah), who had been hiding on the far side of the moon, and the Vampire Clan (Bellanoa), who had been concealed beneath Earth's surface. Humanity is nearly extinct, though a few survivors have gone deep into hiding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/5541898ad97af960a7efb0a58cfdb1b4.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Boss Monster RAID</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In LUNA: War of the Moonlights, various monsters lurk throughout the map. Defeat the most powerful boss monster and break down the barrier to infiltrate enemy lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/4d33bf325aa6fc6f26f3334a51cc5698.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An PvX MORPG with MOBA Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat boss monsters to acquire powerful items, and use them to crush endless waves of monsters and grow even stronger. Collect items of various grades and aim for even higher-grade ones. You can also purchase powerful, high-grade items from the shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.poster.avif?t=1766475377\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.webm?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535090/extras/46f00c60eac889c97b1ea2eb8e76150b.mp4?t=1766475377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time PvP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joi